From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Projet AuxiNux <repo@auxinux.ca>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 21:09:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] shell: French translations of AuxiNux messages

Install the AuxiNux translator (messages added by the AuxiNux patches, such as 'AuxiText cannot be started.' and the 'Open PDF' file filter), which follows the interface language of the shell.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 win-linux/src/main.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/win-linux/src/main.cpp b/win-linux/src/main.cpp
index dd4c339..c9a03e3 100644
--- a/win-linux/src/main.cpp
+++ b/win-linux/src/main.cpp
@@ -190,6 +190,7 @@ int main( int argc, char *argv[] )
     setup_paths(&AscAppManager::getInstance());
 #ifdef AUXI_PRODUCT_NAME
     AuxiNux::applyPrivacyDefaults();
+    AuxiNux::installTranslator();
 #endif
     application_cef->Init_CEF(&AscAppManager::getInstance(), argc, argv);
     /* ********************** */
